{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/fdef4d06f4f1f3f14d40858d427497b0.avif?t=1756308122\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dark city of Midnight City, you embody a detective hunting a serial killer. You have only 4 in-game hours to solve the case - analyze crime descriptions, witness statements, notes, and autopsy reports. Verify information in the police database to sift truth from false leads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/df445b536ec40526ad9d5e777232aca2.poster.avif?t=1756308122\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/df445b536ec40526ad9d5e777232aca2.webm?t=1756308122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/df445b536ec40526ad9d5e777232aca2.mp4?t=1756308122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/afbad3176d19a6b0a114bb3e86137aeb.avif?t=1756308122\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the case files and dive into the investigation! Gather clues on the detective board - pin pages from files, print data from the police database, connect leads into a coherent theory. Designate the location of the next crime, suspect individuals, and select the one killer from among them. Each approach reveals new layers of mysteries and alternative paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/b8fdb0c5aa2397280c6e7d86c0402f7e.poster.avif?t=1756308122\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/b8fdb0c5aa2397280c6e7d86c0402f7e.webm?t=1756308122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/b8fdb0c5aa2397280c6e7d86c0402f7e.mp4?t=1756308122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/fb49b625ffdc0898b3ddf5cefd28f982.avif?t=1756308122\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone mysterious will try to stop you! Repel hacking attacks with logical or dexterity challenges, react to dimming lights by switching fuses before darkness falls. Don't let yourself be distracted because time is not on your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/c33ba0c32e3672db5c3b6bcd7e2aec47.poster.avif?t=1756308122\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/c33ba0c32e3672db5c3b6bcd7e2aec47.webm?t=1756308122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/c33ba0c32e3672db5c3b6bcd7e2aec47.mp4?t=1756308122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/c1db1b8932fa3b6d964312c6d9edaa3c.avif?t=1756308122\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Case file analysis</strong> \u2013 examine reports, testimonies, and field notes to uncover contradictions and hidden clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police database</strong> \u2013 verify people, places, and objects in the MCPD system to confirm or dismiss your theories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective board</strong> \u2013 connect evidence into logical threads and identify the killer and the next crime scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time pressure</strong> \u2013 you have only 4 in-game hours (~30 minutes real time) to solve the case before it\u2019s too late.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple investigations</strong> \u2013 each case comes with unique suspects, documents, and false leads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increasing difficulty</strong> \u2013 later cases demand deeper deduction and sharper time management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High replayability</strong> \u2013 varied clues and case setups ensure every run offers new discoveries.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923680?t=1756308122","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923680?t=1756308122","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/e48f58fc9dc2a431b05fe30c6d74f0d4703eae2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756308122","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/e48f58fc9dc2a431b05fe30c6d74f0d4703eae2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756308122","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing